@verbs hearthstone stone transport mark invoke
@tier player
@title the hearthstone: going home and calling your mount

  mark stone

Marks the place you are standing in as your home. It can only be
done in an inn, and never in combat.

  transport

Takes you to whatever you marked. It takes ten seconds, during
which you can neither move nor fight, or the journey is cut off.
Afterwards the stone is spent for an hour.

If you never marked anything, or the place you marked is gone, it
takes you to the starting place of your race.

  invoke mount

Calls your mount, if you have one.
